{"ts":"2026-08-10T05:45:22.164Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"07e97aa365b211e55b7745cd","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-brief-rrmk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Propagate the docstring gate entry guard fix"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The isMainInvocation guard caught realpathSync errors and returned false, causing npm run docstring to exit 0 having scanned nothing — a mandatory release gate reporting success without doing its job. The guard now propagates the error so a broken environment fails loudly instead of silently passing the gate."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["docstrings","gate"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-10T05:45:22.164Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-10T05:45:22.164Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pi-agent"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"04de00822445ac815f1d2527decfe4ccab3b43c365ac9f58b329329e240c276e","message":""}
{"ts":"2026-08-10T05:45:25.438Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"07e97aa365b211e55b7745cd","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-10T05:45:25.438Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-10T05:45:25.437Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"The isMainInvocation function in scripts/docstring-gate.ts wrapped realpathSync in a try/catch that returned false on ENOENT. When argv[1] could not be resolved, the top-level selector called the no-op placeholder instead of main, so npm run docstring exited 0 having scanned nothing. A required release check reported success without doing its job. The corrected implementation propagates the realpathSync error: a broken environment must not silently satisfy a gate."}]}],"before_hash":"04de00822445ac815f1d2527decfe4ccab3b43c365ac9f58b329329e240c276e","after_hash":"320dd6a30b4aa5ecf291d2f471d0759acb6c48e9200f5cbf4c568c859c9b0e77"}
{"ts":"2026-08-10T05:45:28.023Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"07e97aa365b211e55b7745cd","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-10T05:45:28.023Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-10T05:45:28.023Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Verified: node --experimental-strip-types -e with an unresolvable argv[1] now throws ENOENT instead of returning false. The gate fails loudly."}]}],"before_hash":"320dd6a30b4aa5ecf291d2f471d0759acb6c48e9200f5cbf4c568c859c9b0e77","after_hash":"2b9decb3e089d5e3f5ff8381f209c1572ec4ad88fa4653879695a3277d662c0f"}
